                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Document</hi> F</head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Policy Regarding the Disclosure of Certain
                        Classified Military Information to the North Atlantic Treaty Nations</hi>
                </p>
                <p>It is agreed that both the U.S. and the U.K. have the discretion to release
                    classified U.S.–U.K. combined military information in the fields of established
                    and published technical and tactical training and doctrine and matériel to the
                    nations of the North Atlantic Treaty Organization to permit adequate use of
                    equipment and matériel furnished them by either the U.S. or the U.K.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
